{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人离开了曾经熟悉、却让自己受过委屈的生活。离开后，他发现自己真正舍不得的是曾经被接纳、被亲近的感觉；他既不愿回去重受委屈，也害怕未来只能独自面对生活。最后，他决定珍惜过去的美好，带着遗憾和想念继续向前。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后失落迷茫\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"舍不得快乐又不愿受气\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念亲近仍有心酸\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼亲近又怀疑离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"委屈不该忍仍眷恋\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"重新看见关系里的温暖\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"孤单却不愿委屈回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"回忆只给片刻喘息\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"分不清怀旧还是怕孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"最舍不得曾被接纳\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"先稳住生活暂不回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"伤害与快乐都是真的\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"珍惜亲近也能独自生活\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S03 和 S09—S12：词语密集、情绪反复，而且后几段停留时间很短，需要迅速分辨他究竟是想回去，还是害怕孤单。最抓人的是 S06—S08，刚刚重新感受到过去亲近的温暖，就又被现实中的孤独打断；S13 从激昂走向平静，也让整个故事有了清楚的情感落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1f595e8f-3e39-4659-9113-38b8075ca0e1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190619454559Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:06:54.398715+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5ae5d5d58fe138feb0f28858dbee31ce46698a4062cc5d40ceb9cce395abdf0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190619454559Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7e243d7c6d873b8bb043d9bab6027d0dbfce9391705e09195236bfc387e539a1"}}}
